WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.944
On the morning of the Chenqiao mutiny, the army camp was filled with jubilation.

00:00:05.294 --> 00:00:09.206
Early in the morning, warm sunlight shone over the camp.

00:00:09.556 --> 00:00:14.284
Several generals brought out a yellow robe, the symbol of imperial power.

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:19.098
The yellow robe glittered in the sunlight, especially eye-catching.

00:00:19.448 --> 00:00:24.224
They draped the yellow robe over Zhao Kuangyin's shoulders — he was both startled and overjoyed.

00:00:24.574 --> 00:00:29.254
The soldiers all around began to cheer, their voices rising one after another.

00:00:29.604 --> 00:00:34.212
All the soldiers knelt in homage, shouting 'Long live the new emperor!'

00:00:34.562 --> 00:00:40.778
The great army marched back to Kaifeng; the city gates swung wide open, and the people lined the streets in welcome.

00:00:41.128 --> 00:00:46.432
Both sides of the street were packed with people; everyone wanted to catch a glimpse of the new emperor.

00:00:46.782 --> 00:00:53.862
In the year 960, the Song dynasty was founded, and the Five Dynasties regimes of the Central Plain came to an end.

00:00:54.212 --> 00:00:57.860
A new era began from this very day.

